# FEATURE SPECIFICATIONS

(Implement ALL of the following)

## OCR + Bounding Boxes

* Extract blocks/lines/elements
* Store normalized bounding boxes
* Render correctly on all screen sizes

## Highlighting

* Tap → highlight text region
* Works in result, history, fullscreen

## Smart Crop

* Auto-detect main text region
* Suggest crop → allow manual adjust

## Language + Translation

* Detect language
* Translate text
* Fix history values

## Entity Extraction

* Dates, emails, phones, URLs, locations
* Display grouped + interactive

## Flexible Date Parsing

* Support:

  * Absolute dates
  * Relative dates (tomorrow, next Friday, etc.)
* Prefer future dates
* Handle ambiguity safely

## Document Type Detection

* Rule-based (keywords + entities)
* Types:

  * Invoice
  * Receipt
  * Ticket/Event
  * Official document
  * Note
  * Unknown
* Store result + confidence

## Smart Reminder Suggestion

* Show in-app suggestion ONLY
* Never auto-create reminders
* Use local notifications

## Firebase Analytics

Track:

* scan_completed
* entity_detected
* reminder_suggested
* reminder_created
* reminder_dismissed
* document_type_detected

